      "shortName": "region-drag-surfaces",
      "title": "Add region drag surfaces — additively",
      "status": "planned",
      "description": "`DragSurfaceId` has exactly one variant, `LeftSidebar`. Add right sidebar, top bar and bottom bar. ADDITIVE ONLY: never modify or re-type an existing drag type, never remove or rename a variant. The app constructs these and matches exhaustively, so adding is free and the compiler simply asks for new arms.",
