      "shortName": "bind-any-action-by-name",
      "title": "Let config bind ANY action by name, contributed ones included",
      "status": "planned",
      "description": "keybindings.default.toml and the user's keybindings only speak to built-in `WmAction`s today. The registry is already keyed by name, so this is a lookup, not a new mechanism. Same syntax as a built-in — a user should not need to know whether an action is built in or contributed.",
      "notes": "",
      "statusLog": [],
      "decisions": [],
